{"3609080":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"스타세이비어","steam_appid":3609080,"required_age":"15","is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3609080\/extras\/92f04dfc00d0cbca66ef71ee109c848c.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=420 height=144 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3609080\/extras\/92f04dfc00d0cbca66ef71ee109c848c.mp4?t=1784776433\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >오래전, 공허의 별을 물리친 전설의 '별의 구원자'<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >그가 남긴 위대한 힘을 계승하기 위한 시련, '여정'이 다시 시작된다.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >별의 힘을 가진 소녀들과 '여정' 도전하여, 별의 구원자의 힘을 계승하라.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3609080\/extras\/a964e3c2200c02c2a782d315b1a3440f.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=420 height=144 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3609080\/extras\/a964e3c2200c02c2a782d315b1a3440f.mp4?t=1784776433\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >별이 꺼져 가는 시대,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >다시 우주를 비출 빛나는 존재를 키워내기 위한 육성 RPG.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >별이 깃든 구원자 육성담 &quot;스타세이비어&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3609080\/extras\/2f95bd3bb9104d0b4b229f6ac66aaae0.poster.avif?t=1784776433\" width=420 height=144 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3609080\/extras\/2f95bd3bb9104d0b4b229f6ac66aaae0.mp4?t=1